&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h5 id="steps"&gt;Steps&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Heat water to 92°C.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Place the V60 on your mug and add a paper filter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rinse the filter with hot water.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add ground coffee and let it bloom for 30 seconds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pour water slowly in a circular motion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy your coffee!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
